          "messages": [
            {
              "speaker": "Aurelia 1",
              "text": "Cassian, I'm aware you and Borin have been talking privately. I don't need to know every detail, but I want to be clear: my position and our existing relationship remain as strong as ever. If there's anything affecting that, I expect to hear it directly from you before any irreversible moves are made."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Cassian 3",
              "text": "Aurelia, I appreciate you reaching out directly. You're right that I've been talking with Borin - I talk with everyone, you know that. Our relationship is solid, and I'm not looking to undermine it. That said, I value my autonomy in these conversations. I'll keep you informed if anything material develops that affects us, but I won't be reporting every private exchange. Fair enough?"
            }
          ]
